d38bda8a5c4c"],

Cell["\<\
Diffuse draws every realisation at once, the more often a vertex is used the \
stronger; the branch view follows one construction to the end. Without a pin \
every step is solved over all branches of the earlier ones, and their number \
multiplies. A step can be pinned once it has been reached.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6d10f77c-7135-40a5-9884-f7efd7f035ff"],

